  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MSME Business Loan Program for GHG Emission Reduction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to promote the use of energy efficient and renewable energy solutions in MSMEs and foster gender equal access to funding by ensuring that women-led MSMEs are a core focus of the loan activities.

&#x2022; The program contributes to positive climate mitigation and adaptation impact, as reflected by reduced GHG emission and number of indirect beneficieries. 
&#x2022; It responds to an increasing demand for affordable renewable energy and energy efficiency loan products, as the existing loan conditions are difficult to accept for many businesses. 
&#x2022; GCF concessionality would be passed on to end-beneficiaries, thereby incentivizing a critical mass of Mongolian MSMEs to incorporate environmentally friendly and energy-efficient solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
